OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has said
OL,7,Fadult social care must be reformed
OL,8,Fwith "urgency" in an emotional pledge
OL,9,Fto end the care crisis that has "gone
OL,10,Fon too long".
OL,12,FDuring his speech in London on
OL,13,FWednesday, the new PM made three main
OL,14,Fannouncements giving an insight into
OL,15,Fwhat he sees as priorities for change
OL,16,Fin the sector.
OL,26,@pD@FOUpD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FThese included bringing forward the
OL,7,Fpublication of the independent Casey
OL,8,Fcommission report into social care to
OL,9,F2027, a vow to make this a cross-party
OL,10,Fissue, and an "immediate" focus on the
OL,11,Fsocial care workforce.
OL,13,FITV News spoke to families and those
OL,14,Fwho work within the adult social care
OL,15,Fsector to hear their reaction to
OL,16,FBurnham's plans.
OL,18,F'Nobody pays me'
OL,26,@rD@OOUrD@YO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FClaire Bennett from Salford, Greater
OL,7,FManchester, is a full-time unpaid
OL,8,Fcarer for her mother, Kay Bennett, who
OL,9,Fis 89 and has dementia.
OL,11,FThe family is determined to keep Kay
OL,12,Fin her home as they say she does
OL,13,Fbetter being in a familiar setting,
OL,14,Fbut they feel the current system makes
OL,15,Fthis really difficult, and Claire is
OL,16,Fworried her mother's savings could
OL,17,Fsoon run out.
OL,19,F"Our preference is to have mum at
OL,20,Fhome, but it's very expensive," she
OL,21,Ftold ITV News.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,F"Mum's savings were quite a high level
OL,7,Fbut as the years have gone on, we've
OL,8,Fneeded more and more care. So, those
OL,9,Fsavings are dramatically reducing
OL,10,Fdown."
OL,12,FPart of Kay's routine involves daily
OL,13,Fexercises in her living room with her
OL,14,Fdaughter, and trips to her community
OL,15,Fcentre for music sessions.
OL,17,FThese sessions away from the home are
OL,18,Ftherapeutic for Kay, who has always
OL,19,Floved singing.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FThey also offer some much-needed
OL,7,Frespite for Claire, who works as a
OL,8,Fnurse and used to be full-time until
OL,9,Fshe had to cut her hours to care for
OL,10,Fher mother.
OL,12,FAnd she is not alone.
OL,14,FThere are 4.7 million unpaid carers in
OL,15,FEngland and it is estimated around 600
OL,16,Fpeople give up their jobs each day to
OL,17,Fprovide unpaid care, according to the
OL,18,Fcharity Carers UK.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,F"It's very challenging because I now
OL,7,Fwork 17 hours when I used to be full
OL,8,Ftime," Claire said.
OL,10,F"So, for me, I earn a lot less money,
OL,11,Fand that's had a massive impact on my
OL,12,Fincome and my pension as well.
OL,14,F"It's a stress for me because,
OL,15,Fhopefully, I'll be here for many more
OL,16,Fyears, but my finances are dwindling
OL,17,Fand nobody obviously pays me."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FClaire is cautiously optimistic about
OL,7,Fthe new PM, who was formerly her mayor
OL,8,Ffor six years, and his approach to
OL,9,Fadult social care. She praised his
OL,10,Fopenness about his own experience of
OL,11,Fthe system.
OL,13,FBurnham, whose father has Alzheimer's,
OL,14,Fpromised on Wednesday to reform social
OL,15,Fcare to help "my dad and the millions
OL,16,Flike him" who he said are faced with
OL,17,Fthe unfairness of the current system.
OL,26,@wD@NOUxD@IO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,F"I felt he was very passionate about
OL,7,Fsocial care, so it makes me feel
OL,8,Fpositive that it's something that's
OL,9,Fgoing to be on his agenda, and high on
OL,10,Fhis agenda, to push for," Claire said.
OL,12,F'Staff feel under-appreciated and
OL,13,Fundervalued'
OL,15,FThis cautious optimism appears to be
OL,16,Fechoed across a sector that has often
OL,17,Ffelt ignored and overlooked, with many
OL,18,Fcharities welcoming adult social care
OL,19,Fbeing brought into the spotlight.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
