PN,31509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FClaire Rintoul, CEO of Sheffcare, runs
OL,7,Fnine care homes and two-day centres,
OL,8,Fcaring for over 1,000 older people in
OL,9,FSheffield.
OL,11,F"For some reason social care just
OL,12,Fdoesn't get the same profile and
OL,13,Fattention and I think people aren't as
OL,14,Faware of social care as they are
OL,15,Fhealth," she told ITV News.
OL,17,F"But social care tends to hit you like
OL,18,Fa ton of bricks when you most need it."
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FFinancial support is key, according to
OL,7,FMs Rintoul, for a sector that has
OL,8,Fsuffered under years of funding cuts.
OL,10,F"It's really hard for our staff
OL,11,Fworking in social care because they
OL,12,Ffeel under-appreciated and
OL,13,Fundervalued," she said.
OL,15,F"There's just not enough money going
OL,16,Finto the sector at all. Not enough to
OL,17,Fpay people well, to repair the
OL,18,Fbuildings, to invest in technology,
OL,19,Fbut there is more and more pressure.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31511
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,F"People are coming to us more and more
OL,7,Fpoorly. Ultimately, it's people that
OL,8,Fsuffer, it's families that suffer,"
OL,9,Fshe added.
OL,11,FIn his speech on Wednesday, Burnham
OL,12,Fsaid he wanted to "immediately" focus
OL,13,Fon the social care workforce, rather
OL,14,Fthan waiting for the Casey review to
OL,15,Fbe completed.
OL,17,FHe paid tribute to the skills of care
OL,18,Fstaff, insisting they "should be the
OL,19,Fbest-paid people in society, not the
OL,20,Fworst", and suggested carers should be
OL,21,Fmore integrated with the NHS workforce.
OL,26,@tD@SOUtD@_O]zD@WOU|D@FO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31512
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FHe said he was now tasking the
OL,7,Fministerial group on social care ` led
OL,8,Fby Home Secretary Yvette Cooper, and
OL,9,Finvolving Housing, Communities and
OL,10,FLocal Government Secretary Angela
OL,11,FRayner and Chancellor John Healey.
OL,13,FHe said the group will "look at how we
OL,14,Fturn the fair pay agreement into a
OL,15,Fbigger reform to improve the social
OL,16,Fcare workforce" and "lift it closer to
OL,17,FNHS standards".
OL,19,F'Parties need to come together on this'
OL,26,@xD@OO]xD@UOUyD@NO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31513
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FEmma Smith runs the Manchester-based
OL,7,Fcharity Empowered Conversations, which
OL,8,Foffers therapeutic sessions, and
OL,9,Fonline support groups and courses to
OL,10,Ffamilies and caregivers for people
OL,11,Fliving with dementia.
OL,13,FHer message to the new PM, who has
OL,14,Fpreviously joined sessions with the
OL,15,Fcharity during his time as Mayor of
OL,16,FGreater Manchester, is clear: "Don't
OL,17,Fmess this up, Andy".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31514
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FMs Smith welcomed the suggestion of a
OL,7,F"preventative front-end social care
OL,8,Fservice" stopping people from going
OL,9,Finto hospital in the first place.
OL,11,FIn his speech, the PM said it costs
OL,12,Fthe NHS around #2.5 billion a year to
OL,13,Fhave people kept in hospital even
OL,14,Fthough they are medically fit to leave
OL,15,Fbecause there is no suitable care
OL,16,Favailable in the community.
OL,18,F"Family caregivers are being let down,
OL,19,Fwe know the trajectory of dementia and
OL,20,Fthe impact it will have on families,"
OL,21,FMs Smith told ITV News.
OL,26,@oD@AOUpD@HO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31515
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,F"A preventative approach saves the
OL,7,Fsystem money, it keeps families
OL,8,Ftogether and it empowers people to
OL,9,Flive their lives as they want.
OL,11,F"It needs to change, the parties need
OL,12,Fto come together on this - it can't be
OL,13,Fbrushed over again," she added.
OL,15,FThe prime minister has promised to
OL,16,Fmake this a cross-party issue,
OL,17,Fconfirming on Wednesday that he will
OL,18,Fbe holding talks with the
OL,19,FConservatives and Liberal Democract
OL,20,Fleaders in an attempt to find common
OL,21,Fground across party lines.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31516
SC,0016
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FHowever, any hope that this could be
OL,7,Fan easy fix is far from reality.
OL,9,FThe Conservatives may have accepted
OL,10,Fthe offer for talks, but there is no
OL,11,Fclear indication they would support
OL,12,FBurnham's proposals, while even within
OL,13,Fhis own party several Labour MPs have
OL,14,Fexpressed concern over how to manage
OL,15,Fthe financial burden of his suggested
OL,16,Fchanges to the sector.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G16/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31517
SC,0017
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F315A1785358073
OL,3,C'Don't mess it up, Andy': Carers react
OL,4,Cto Burnham's social care plans
OL,6,FMeanwhile, the Green Party and Reform
OL,7,FUK, who both did not receive any
OL,8,Finvite to join these talks, have
OL,9,Fcriticised their lack of involvement,
OL,10,Fwith the Greens branding it
OL,11,F"disappointing".
OL,13,FReform UK's Treasury spokesman Robert
OL,14,FJenrick even went as far as to say his
OL,15,Fparty would fight any attempt to
OL,16,Fintroduce a "universal death tax" to
OL,17,Ffund social care.
OL,19,FFor many in the adult social care
OL,20,Fsystem, the future is still uncertain.
OL,26,@xD@MOUxD@aO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G17/18
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
